Lay a trap that releases a radius 3 cloud of thick poisonous gas lasting 4 turns.

Each turn, the cloud poisons all within ([166, 198, 222, 242, 260 (TRAP MASTERY TL1-5; CUN 100)] nature damage over 5 turns).   There is a 25% chance the poison is enhanced with crippling, numbing or insidious effects.

This trap can use a primed trigger and a high level lure can trigger it.
